                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>The Everden Red Light Knee Wrap combines 660nm red and 850nm near-infrared light, soothing heat and gentle massage in one cordless wrap. Strap it on, press one button, and sit back for 15 minutes. It's a simple daily recovery routine you can do on the couch, at your desk or after a long day.</p>",
