                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<ul><li>Light: 660nm red + 850nm near-infrared LEDs, 5 brightness levels</li><li>Massage: 3 vibration levels</li><li>Heat: 3 levels, 113°F / 122°F / 131°F (45°C / 50°C / 55°C)</li><li>Auto shut-off: after 30 minutes</li><li>Battery: 5000mAh rechargeable, cordless use</li><li>Charging: 5V 2A</li><li>Material: neoprene wrap with hook-and-loop strap</li><li>Size: one size, adjustable</li></ul><p><strong>In the box:</strong> 1 knee wrap, 1 USB charging cable (wall plug not included; a standard USB phone charger plug works) and 1 user manual. The 2-pack comes with two of each.</p>",
